    "Photos, videos and voice never leave your device. PicShop has no servers, no accounts and no tracking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photos, videos and voice never leave your device. PicShop has no servers, no accounts and no tracking."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos photos, vidéos et votre voix ne quittent jamais votre appareil. PicShop n'a ni serveur, ni compte, ni suivi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PicShop always uses the most capable brain available on this iPhone. The instant grammar answers first; the language model steps in for complex or ambiguous requests. Everything runs on device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PicShop always uses the most capable brain available on this iPhone. The instant grammar answers first; the language model steps in for complex or ambiguous requests. Everything runs on device."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PicShop utilise toujours le cerveau le plus capable disponible sur cet iPhone. La grammaire instantanée répond en premier ; le modèle de langage intervient pour les demandes complexes ou ambiguës. Tout fonctionne sur l'appareil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PicShop couldn't find a subject to focus on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PicShop couldn't find a subject to focus on."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PicShop n'a pas trouvé de sujet sur lequel faire la mise au point."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PicShop is rendering lighter previews to keep your iPhone cool.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PicShop is rendering lighter previews to keep your iPhone cool."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PicShop affiche des aperçus allégés pour garder votre iPhone au frais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PicShop picks the best part of each clip and cuts to the music.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PicShop picks the best part of each clip and cuts to the music."
